<view class="container">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">看看出门常带什么</view>
    <view class="muted">选一份常用清单，用到你的场所，之后再按自己习惯增删。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:for="{{presetsList}}" wx:key="key">
    <view class="card-title">{{item.label}}</view>
    <view class="tags">
      <text class="tag" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="it" wx:key="*this">{{it}}</text>
    </view>
    <button class="btn-primary apply-btn" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onUse">用到场所</button>
  </view>
  <view class="muted note">清单内容来自社区共建，欢迎在 GitHub 提交更多场景。</view>
</view>